cc @nden","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astropy/astropy/issues/16591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astropy/astropy/issues/16591/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astropy/astropy/issues/comments/2209914570","html_url":"https://github.com/astropy/astropy/issues/16591#issuecomment-2209914570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/astropy/astropy/issues/16591","id":2209914570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAB_CCc6DuJ7K","user":{"login":"WilliamJamieson","id":20687711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjg3NzEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20687711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson","html_url":"https://github.com/WilliamJamieson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WilliamJamieson/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-05T03:14:45Z","updated_at":"2024-07-05T03:14:45Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"It was my understanding that the expectation was to assign those traits to the underlying models before being joined together by the `CompoundModel`. This is because the "names" of the different parameter values with respect to the compound model are generate